# OPTIONAL — base URL of the prediction API.
#
# You normally don't need this: production builds default to the deployed API
# (https://slope-stability-api.vercel.app) and `npm run dev` defaults to the
# local backend (http://localhost:8000). See src/lib/api.ts.
#
# Set it only to point the site at a different backend — copy this file to
# .env.local for local dev, or add VITE_API_BASE in the Vercel dashboard
# (Settings -> Environment Variables) and redeploy. No trailing slash.
VITE_API_BASE=https://slope-stability-api.vercel.app
